      "content": "but starting over sounds even more pathetic. like, imagine being 30 and having to act like a beginner again after actually being good. i don't want to be a beginner. i don't want to be a \"struggling\" artist. if i can't be the person i was, then there's no point in even being here. it's better to just go out on top than to rot slowly.",
